  "title": "GestAdapt and ECHO-G: Workspace-Conditioned Co-Speech Gesture and Motion Generation",
  "summary": "GestAdapt and ECHO-G present frameworks for generating co-speech gestures and motions for humanoid robots, adapting to the workspace constraints while preserving natural human motion. These frameworks use joint conditioning of speech, motion, and workspace to achieve better performance.",
